<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00703">
	<title>Parking Safety button</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" outputclass="FormatA" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" height="1.573in" href="../../images/OOV055018.eps" placement="break" width="2.243in"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ul id="e04553">
								<li>
									<p>Press the Parking Safety button (<image align="left" height="0.117in" href="../../images/WKIA_087.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" width="0.117in" id="e04554"/>) to turn on Forward/Side/Reverse Parking Distance Warning.</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>Press the button again to turn off the function.</p>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>When the gear is shift to R (Reverse), Parking Distance Warning will automatically turn on (Parking Safety button indicator on).</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>